551
00:57:53,573 --> 00:57:54,973
<i>Alô?</i>

552
00:57:56,977 --> 00:57:58,377
<i>Ainda está aí?</i>

553
00:57:59,980 --> 00:58:01,380
<i>Alô?</i>

554
00:58:01,882 --> 00:58:03,515
Sim, estou aqui.

555
00:58:05,018 --> 00:58:07,853
<i>Pelo o que entendi,</i>

556
00:58:07,854 --> 00:58:10,723
